# Prompt-Gineer frontend configuration
#
# VITE_API_URL controls where the frontend calls the backend:
#   - Leave it UNSET to use relative "/api/..." requests. In local dev the Vite
#     dev server proxies /api to the worker on port 8787; in production set this
#     to your deployed Cloudflare Worker URL.
#   - Example for production:
#       VITE_API_URL="https://prompt-gineer-api.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev"
#
# For local live preview we intentionally leave it unset (relative + proxy).
